# Phase 4: the pause menu's DISPLAY rows FPS TARGET and FRAME GENERATION: opened, stepped and
# switched with the pad, the cap going to HALF DISPLAY (mcla_fps_frame_generation, -1) while
# frame generation is on and back to mcla_fps when it is off, saved when backing out.
# Run with --fps 45 --fps-fg half (devrun.py) and read the `dev pad: get` lines, the
# `settings menu:` lines and mcla.toml.after in the run folder.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark settle
wait 3s
press start 4f
wait 2s
press rb 4f
wait 1s
press rb 4f
wait 1s
press down 4f
wait 700ms
press down 4f
wait 700ms
press down 4f
wait 700ms
press down 4f
wait 1s
press a 4f
wait 1500ms
get mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation frame_generation frame_generation_available frame_generation_why
press down 4f
wait 1s
press right 4f
wait 2s
get mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation frame_generation
press up 4f
wait 1s
press right 4f
wait 1500ms
get mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation frame_generation
press left 4f
wait 1s
press left 4f
wait 1500ms
get mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation frame_generation
press right 4f
wait 1500ms
get mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation frame_generation
press down 4f
wait 1s
press left 4f
wait 2s
get mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation frame_generation
press up 4f
wait 1s
press right 4f
wait 1500ms
get mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation frame_generation
press b 4f
wait 2s
mark end
wait 1s
